# 6️⃣ Floyd Warshall Algorithm

## Purpose

Find:

```text
Shortest Path
Between Every Pair
Of Vertices
```

---

### Example

Find shortest path:

```text
1 → 2

1 → 3

2 → 4

3 → 4

for every pair.
```

---

# 7️⃣ Floyd Warshall Idea

Try every node as:

```text
Intermediate Node
```

---

### Formula

```cpp
dist[i][j]
=
min(
dist[i][j],
dist[i][via] +
dist[via][j]
);
```

---

# 8️⃣ Floyd Warshall Code

```cpp
for(int via=0;
    via<n;
    via++)
{
    for(int i=0;
        i<n;
        i++)
    {
        for(int j=0;
            j<n;
            j++)
        {
            dist[i][j] =
            min(
                dist[i][j],
                dist[i][via]
                +
                dist[via][j]
            );
        }
    }
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(V³)

Space: O(V²)
```

