# 1️⃣3️⃣ Kruskal Algorithm

## Idea

Sort edges by:

```text
Weight
```

Take smallest edge first.

Avoid cycles.

---

### Tools Needed

```text
Sorting
+
DSU
```

---

# 1️⃣4️⃣ Kruskal Steps

### Step 1

Sort edges.

### Step 2

Take smallest edge.

### Step 3

If cycle not formed:

```text
Include edge
```

Otherwise:

```text
Skip
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(E log E)

Space: O(V)
```

