# 1️⃣5️⃣ Disjoint Set Union (DSU)

Also called:

```text
Union Find
```

Used for:

```text
Cycle Detection
Kruskal MST
Dynamic Connectivity
```

---

# 1️⃣6️⃣ DSU Operations

### Find Parent

```cpp
int findParent(int node)
{
    if(node == parent[node])
        return node;

    return findParent(
        parent[node]
    );
}
```

---

### Union

```cpp
parent[u] = v;
```

Combine two sets.

---

# 1️⃣7️⃣ Path Compression

## Problem

Without optimization:

```text
Find Parent
```

can become:

```text
O(N)
```

---

### Optimization

```cpp
int findParent(int node)
{
    if(node == parent[node])
        return node;

    return parent[node]
        =
    findParent(
        parent[node]
    );
}
```

---

### Benefit

Almost:

```text
O(1)
```

per operation.

---

# 1️⃣8️⃣ Union By Rank

Attach smaller tree below larger tree.

Maintain:

```cpp
rank[]
```

---

### Code

```cpp
void unionByRank(
    int u,
    int v)
{
    u = findParent(u);
    v = findParent(v);

    if(u == v)
        return;

    if(rank[u] < rank[v])
    {
        parent[u] = v;
    }
    else if(rank[v] < rank[u])
    {
        parent[v] = u;
    }
    else
    {
        parent[v] = u;

        rank[u]++;
    }
}
```

---

# 1️⃣9️⃣ Union By Size

Maintain:

```cpp
size[]
```

Attach smaller set to larger set.

---

### Code

```cpp
void unionBySize(
    int u,
    int v)
{
    u = findParent(u);
    v = findParent(v);

    if(u == v)
        return;

    if(size[u] < size[v])
    {
        parent[u] = v;

        size[v] += size[u];
    }
    else
    {
        parent[v] = u;

        size[u] += size[v];
    }
}
```

---

# 2️⃣0️⃣ DSU Complexity

With:

```text
Path Compression
+
Union By Rank
```

Complexity becomes:

```text
O(α(N))
```

Almost constant time.

