# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Dijkstra cannot handle negative edges.

✅ Bellman Ford handles negative edges.

✅ Floyd Warshall gives all-pairs shortest path.

✅ MST always contains V−1 edges.

✅ Kruskal uses DSU.

✅ DSU is one of the most important interview topics.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting path compression.

❌ Not sorting edges in Kruskal.

❌ Using Dijkstra for negative edges.

❌ Confusing MST with shortest path.

❌ Forgetting negative cycle detection.

